{
  "title": "Warm Malty Indian Paneer Palak Paneer",
  "description": "A malty, gooey, post-workout Indian dish featuring nduja and palak paneer, this recipe is low-fat-friendly and perfect for a weeknight dinner.",
  "cuisine": "Indian",
